WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.436 --> 00:00:03.236
Unit five. Chronic Disease Prevention!

2
00:00:04.182 --> 00:00:07.800
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:11.167
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.217 --> 00:00:14.900
Today we learn about Chronic Disease Prevention. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.573 --> 00:00:19.573
Chronic disease. Say it with me. Chronic disease!

6
00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:26.750
Diabetes. Say it with me. Diabetes!

7
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.800
Heart disease. Say it with me. Heart disease!

8
00:00:37.362 --> 00:00:41.129
Risk reduction. Say it with me. Risk reduction!

9
00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:48.160
Healthy weight. Say it with me. Healthy weight!

10
00:00:51.682 --> 00:00:55.766
Blood pressure. Say it with me. Blood pressure!

11
00:00:59.232 --> 00:01:02.515
Screening. Say it with me. Screening!

12
00:01:05.994 --> 00:01:10.244
Prevention strategy. Say it with me. Prevention strategy!

13
00:01:13.736 --> 00:01:25.190
A chronic disease like diabetes or heart disease often develops slowly over many years. Maintaining a healthy weight and normal blood pressure supports risk reduction. Regular screening is part of a good prevention strategy.

14
00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:27.882
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:29.464 --> 00:01:34.546
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:34.596 --> 00:01:35.875
Heart disease!

17
00:01:36.987 --> 00:01:41.974
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:42.024 --> 00:01:43.133
Screening!

19
00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:51.037
Did you know? Many chronic diseases that appear in adulthood are strongly linked to habits formed during the teenage years.

20
00:01:51.087 --> 00:01:52.834
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:53.530 --> 00:02:02.238
Think and answer. What lifestyle choices can help reduce the risk of chronic disease?

22
00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.438
Great answer!

23
00:02:04.461 --> 00:02:09.467
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:09.517 --> 00:02:12.269
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

